## Security Improvement

```diff
- VITE_NOCODB_API_TOKEN=ia8adC8Rq...  (full DB access, exposed in frontend)
+ VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbG...    (safe to expose, RLS-protected)
```

